{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123419","id":5425565597,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDKGZjQ","number":123419,"title":"Allow `_get_minimum_size()` and `_get_maximum_size()` to always be overriden.","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-11T14:38:11Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T22:43:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123419","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123419","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123419.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123419.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nCurrently, custom `Control` classes cannot always define a custom `_get_minimum_size()` or `_get_maximum_size()` that will be called, as outlined in the docs: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_control.html#class-control-private-method-get-minimum-size.\r\n\r\nThis is a completely artificial limitation due to the engine classes overriding the GDVirtual caller instead of using the more standard pattern of\r\n```cpp\r\nClass::method() {\r\n  if (!GDVIRTUAL_CALL(_method) {\r\n    _method();\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nwith the subclasses overriding `_method()` instead of `method()`.\r\n\r\nBy changing engine classes to use the standard pattern, users can now override those methods for any custom `Control` subclass. \r\n\r\nThis also prevents issues like the one fixed in #123415, since the virtual caller is no longer overridable. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAll engine methods are also now strictly `virtual` on top of `override`, so the virtual chain is always extendable. \r\nAlso fixes a doc issue with regard to `_get_maximum_size()`'s default return value. \r\n\r\nIn the future, once #123141 (or equivalent) is added to the engine, we can also fully allow users to use engine-defined classes' implementations in their own derived implementations thanks to these changes. ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123419/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}